{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19269","headline":"罢郡归洛阳寄友人 · 刘禹锡","name":"罢郡归洛阳寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远谪年犹少，初归鬓已衰。\n门闲故吏去，室静老僧期。\n不见蜘蛛集，频爲佝偻欺。\n颖微囊未出，寒甚谷难吹。\n濩落唯心在，平生有己知。\n商歌夜深後，听者竟爲谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}